control: A screen's text, rows, cursor, focus, range fields and loading timers follow the route, answers, range and read in view
removes: live text builds its computed once and never again, so another run or an answer read again never reaches it
packages: ./ui/browser/test/jobs.test.tsx
tests: a new tick replaces the card's run, and its next event reaches the card | a poll's re-read reaches the cards and the rows | a reconnect's re-read puts a new run first, and every row keeps its own run's cells
scheduled-count: no
runner: bun

